<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri" ALIGN="justify">As of June&nbsp;30, 2026, the Company had approximately $25.0&nbsp;million of cash, cash equivalents and restricted cash and $522.4&nbsp;million in
